1
00:00:00,065 --> 00:00:03,315
(Leonard:)Oh, not junior rodeo.

2
00:00:04,611 --> 00:00:05,901
(Leonard:)What did you do?

3
00:00:06,071 --> 00:00:09,611
(Sheldon:)I had no choice, Leonard.
She ruined laundry night.

4
00:00:11,660 --> 00:00:13,330
Ooh!

5
00:00:14,204 --> 00:00:16,624
SHELDON:
Mua-ha-ha.

6
00:00:26,216 --> 00:00:29,346
(Penny:)Telephone wires can't electrocute you,
can they?

7
00:00:30,095 --> 00:00:32,095
(Leonard:)No. Look, this has to stop.

8
00:00:32,264 --> 00:00:35,144
- Oh, no, no, no. It is just beginning.
- All right.

9
00:00:35,767 --> 00:00:39,057
I really didn't wanna do this...

10
00:00:40,605 --> 00:00:41,645
...but here.

11
00:00:42,274 --> 00:00:43,484
What this?

12
00:00:44,568 --> 00:00:46,648
(Leonard:)Sheldon's kryptonite.

13
00:00:49,156 --> 00:00:51,656
(Penny:)Oh, my God.

14
00:00:52,743 --> 00:00:54,873
(Leonard:)He can never know
that I gave that to you.

15
00:00:55,287 --> 00:00:57,877
(Penny:)Look, I said I wanted to hurt him, but...

16
00:00:58,040 --> 00:01:01,020
(Penny:)But this?

